# Save the Children (San d'Oria 1-3) at Grilau: a first completion in Northern San d'Oria. A level 75 Warrior of San
# d'Oria, rank 1 with 1-1 and 1-2 completed (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Grilau's script opens the
# mission list 1009; option 102: begun, Status 1 (Northern San d'Oria's 1009). Status 4 (a GM): Grilau 1004 (not
# completed); finished (Northern San d'Oria's 1004): rank 2, 1000 gil, completed, Option 1.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1004
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-240.5,7,57.9 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
login
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: his script's mission list 1009
finish option=102                       # begun, Status 1
missionstatus Sandoria 4                # a GM
trigger Grilau                          # section 4, not completed: 1004
finish                                  # rank 2, 1000 gil, completed, Option 1
